{"product_id":"badbad-chenille-patch","title":"BADBAD Chenille Patch","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMake a statement with the BADBAD Chenille Patch! Measuring 7.5 inches, this bold patch is designed to make a strong impact on your jackets, bags, and other fabric accessories. The patch features a striking BADBAD design, crafted with high-quality chenille thread, making it a unique addition to your custom projects. With iron-on backing, this patch is quick and easy to apply to any fabric.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eProduct Features:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSize: 7.5 inches – Ideal for customizing jackets, backpacks, and larger accessories.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDesign: Features a bold BADBAD design in vibrant chenille with fine embroidery detailing.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBacking: Iron-on backing for easy and secure application—no sewing required.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMaterial: Made with durable chenille fabric and high-quality embroidery thread for lasting use.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"patchkraze","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45367613522004,"sku":null,"price":10.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0661\/2965\/7940\/files\/badbad.webp?v=1775756144","url":"https:\/\/patchkraze.com\/products\/badbad-chenille-patch","provider":"patchkraze","version":"1.0","type":"link"}